Z||000008||JohnF||12-24-2001||07:52 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Kelvin Vivian:<BR><B>Usually I hear the "pop" when I make hard right turn while driving...<P>Kelvin</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Classic wheel bearing pop.  Take off right front wheel and check bearing before you go to a shop.  You may save your self some grief.<P><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://photos.msn.com/ImageServer/Image.aspx?Image=0h9xCkj4Yyo6VbTdcNrmhglJSkAWB6C91volMeDlp0h*oii8TPGa20kyOxpdcqzP8qgFSFmsURSXXLzrLUqyll5ofimdP92*FNFuzBBDM1PEajQxQ*Q8WWq*rfvz6!x4pUtE2EsH24ClDyP3oWXL*H41TkaSbtSsDJGlSZ4dol6UKjqoNXe9R!uqr1PsTEkyvCkblQOE!Ntm6y7ZIR0Yh4dj5E3iRUs!aOGI2F9kotBxoa!4otRtSuGucZ1Pen9q24d0hrglVvzK*EY4KHAosZ4!AMC1kyuNFUR*urYcA*t61aKP0zREsXUVoyq0!cXPxGXJFnyglKwpMClTPrmLCQv*qNBY9KpHMNz9*AOylphEbbQcqGuVPQ$$"> <P>You can have all the SPEED you can afford!||||reg||9
